# Welcome[¶](#welcome "Permanent link")

Welcome to the [Textual](https://github.com/Textualize/textual) framework documentation.

[Get started](getting_started/) or go straight to the [Tutorial](tutorial/)

## What is Textual?[¶](#what-is-textual "Permanent link")

Textual is a *Rapid Application Development* framework for Python, built by [Textualize.io](https://www.textualize.io).

Build sophisticated user interfaces with a simple Python API. Run your apps in the terminal *or* a [web browser](https://github.com/Textualize/textual-serve)!

- ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) **Rapid development**

---
    Uses your existing Python skills to build beautiful user interfaces.

- ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) **Low requirements**

---
    Run Textual on a single board computer if you want to.

- ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCI+PHBhdGggZD0iTTMgMTJWNi43NWw2LTEuMzJ2Ni40OHptMTctOXY4Ljc1bC0xMCAuMTVWNS4yMXpNMyAxM2w2IC4wOXY2LjgxbC02LTEuMTV6bTE3IC4yNVYyMmwtMTAtMS45MVYxMy4xeiIgLz48L3N2Zz4=) ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) **Cross platform**

---
    Textual runs just about everywhere.

- ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) **Remote**

---
    Textual apps can run over SSH.

- ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) **CLI Integration**

---
    Textual apps can be launched and run from the command prompt.

- ![SVG Image](data:image/svg+xml;base64,) **Open Source**

---
    Textual is licensed under MIT.

